        "id": "TS-001",
        "resolution": "Implemented 2026-08-22: authorize_action loads the persisted approval for the exact action digest, the SPARK-proved Approvals.Consume_Approval accepts it exactly once, the consumed record is made durable (F_FULLFSYNC + atomic rename) before the Action_Authorized event commits, and every failure path refuses (no_approval, approval_corrupt, approval_replayed, approval_revoked, approval_expired, mission/action mismatch). Approvals are issued only through the create_approval protocol command in the PLANNING state and can never be re-armed (Persist_Approval refuses overwrite)."
      },
      {
        "authorized_by": {
          "contract": "receipts/production-readiness-20260821/trust-surface/TS_CONTINUATION_CONTRACT_2026-08-22.md",
          "contract_sha256": "920900f3a7d37a9a3e1d51541997070789a0e1e7bddecf31808076c67a00d3f9",
          "date": "2026-08-22"
        },
        "description": "Replacing the synthesized capability grant with persisted parent and attenuated child grants changes capability issuance and replay semantics.",
        "enforced_by": [
          "kernel/src/nemesis-kernel-capabilities.ads",
          "kernel/src/nemesis-kernel-capabilities.adb",
          "daemon/src/nemesis_core_daemon.adb",
          "daemon/src/nemesis-core-authority_store.adb",
          "tests/integration/test_daemon_api.py",
          "kernel/tests/nemesis_authority_tests.adb"
        ],
        "id": "TS-002",
        "resolution": "Implemented 2026-08-22: the per-request synthesized grant is gone. A single immutable parent grant per mission is issued through the create_grant protocol command in the PLANNING state (all authority fields derived from the authorized mission context; the protocol cannot widen them) and persisted durably. authorize_action loads it and derives the per-action child through the SPARK-proved Capabilities.Derive_Child_Grant, whose postcondition guarantees Is_Attenuation (Parent, Child); a runtime Is_Attenuation re-check remains as defense in depth. Missing, corrupt, or inactive parents refuse (no_parent_grant, grant_corrupt, parent_grant_inactive)."
      }
    ],
